{
  "dataList": [
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴求吧。如这份渴求般，分毫不留地摄取吧。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>缠结吧。随后，毫不留情地吞下吧。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>期望吧。如这份期望般，绝不罢休地消耗吧。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_HighDomestic_4",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#cf0000>渴求吧。如此便能缠结。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_1",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>纵使可以满足，也不应因此满足，纵使可以享受，也应克制忍受。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_2",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>勿行多余之事，遵从秩序行动。</color>"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "NAR_3F_Le_Noir_3",
      "texts": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "text": "<color=#7d7d7d>不可违抗规则。西西弗将铭记汝等忍耐的一切痛苦。</color>"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}